          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Yes. You can learn data analytics without having any prior knowledge of coding. You can start entirely with Excel and visualisation tools. SQL is the first coding skill to add, and it is beginner-friendly. Python is an advanced learning that you can learn later and is not mandatory for many entry-level roles.&quot;,
