          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Power BI is generally recommended for Indian job seekers because it integrates well with Microsoft tools widely used by Indian companies. Tableau is popular in global MNCs. Learning one thoroughly is more valuable than learning both superficially.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
